#
# Smart process runner for Lucky.
# Automatically purges rogue orphan processes spawned during Web self-restart,
# then atomically transforms into the official procd-managed instance via exec.

# 1. Clean up any rogue orphan lucky processes to instantly release listen ports
orphan_pids=$(pidof /usr/bin/lucky)
[ -n "$orphan_pids" ] && kill -9 $orphan_pids >/dev/null 2>&1

# 2. Atomically replace process image, retaining controlled PID under procd supervision
exec /usr/bin/lucky "$@"
